# ripgrep skips these: the linguist-generated paths in .gitattributes. Not .ignore: Nx reads that and loses the lockfile.
# Regenerate the list below: awk '/linguist-(generated|vendored)/{print $1}' .gitattributes
# Search them anyway: rg --no-ignore-dot
